/* HermeshKit's text in Simplified Chinese, by its English (the source, in the code). */

/* The first of several requests in a batch */
"%@ (1 of %lld)" = "%1$@ 等 %2$lld 项";
"%@ (verification code %@)" = "%1$@（核对码 %2$@）";
"%@ requests: %@" = "%1$@ 请求：%2$@";
"%@, and reissue the credentials it signed (%lld)" = "%1$@，并重新签发 %2$lld 项凭证";
/* The number of trusted devices */
"%lld in all once it joins" = "加入后共 %lld 台";
"(Hermesh has no record of its settings before the change, so they can’t be compared.)" = "（Hermesh 里没有找到它修改前的记录，所以无法对比。）";
"(What applies before the change comes from Hermesh’s current list; what applies after it comes from what will be signed.)" = "（“修改前”取自 Hermesh 当前的列表；“修改后”来自要签名的内容。）";
/* Separates the items of a list */
", " = "、";
"A separate git worktree for each session; the directory itself is left alone" = "每个会话用独立的 git worktree，不动原目录";
"Add project “%@” to %@" = "在%2$@上添加项目「%1$@」";
"Add this Mac to your Hermesh" = "让这台 Mac 加入你的 Hermesh";
"Add this iPhone to your Hermesh" = "让这台 iPhone 加入你的 Hermesh";
"Add “%@” as a trusted device" = "把「%@」加为可信设备";
"All" = "全部";
/* Label of a card row with a limit beyond the defaults */
"Also" = "另外";
"Approve a new machine" = "批准一台新机器加入";
"Approve only if that device is in your hands." = "只在那台设备就在你手上时批准。";
"Approve only if you started erasing everything yourself." = "只在是你自己发起的全部清空时批准。";
"Approve “%@” to connect to your computer" = "批准「%@」连接你的电脑";
"Available coding agents: %@" = "可用的编码 Agent：%@";
"Base branch: %@" = "基准分支：%@";
"Can also see other personal agents’ sessions in these projects" = "还能看到这些项目里其他个人 agent 的会话";
"Change the access of personal agent “%@”" = "修改个人 agent「%@」的权限";
"Coding agents" = "编码 Agent";
"Coding agents it can run: %@" = "可调用的编码 agent：%@";
"Coding agents: %@" = "编码 agent：%@";
"Coding agents: %@ → %@" = "编码 agent：%1$@ → %2$@";
"Connects through %@, which holds its key" = "经由 %@ 连接，由它保管密钥";
"Create your owner identity" = "创建你的管理身份";
"Create your owner key" = "生成你的管理密钥";
"Creates your owner key in this Mac’s Secure Enclave. Without it, no one can use the services on your computers, and only you can approve, with Touch ID." = "用这台 Mac 的安全芯片生成你的管理密钥。没有它，谁也用不了你电脑上的服务，只能由你按下 Touch ID 批准。";
"Creates your owner key in this iPhone’s Secure Enclave. Without it, no one can use the services on your computers, and only you can approve, with Face ID." = "用这台 iPhone 的安全芯片生成你的管理密钥。没有它，谁也用不了你电脑上的服务，只能由你用面容 ID 批准。";
"Description: %@" = "说明：%@";
"Device" = "设备";
"Device name: %@" = "设备名：%@";
"Device “%@”" = "设备「%@」";
"Directory: %@" = "目录：%@";
"Erase ID: %@" = "清空 ID：%@";
"Erase everything in your Hermesh" = "清空你的 Hermesh 的全部内容";
"Expires" = "有效期";
"Expires: %@" = "有效期至：%@";
"Expires: %@ (before the change: %@)" = "有效期：至 %1$@（修改前至 %2$@）";
"Fast" = "快速";
"Fingerprint: %@" = "指纹：%@";
"Full trust: in the chosen projects, it can do anything you can." = "完全信任：它在所选项目里能做你本人能做的一切。";
"Full trust: on the chosen machines, this personal agent can do anything you can, including reading credentials and accessing the network." = "完全信任：这个个人 agent 在所选机器上能做你本人能做的一切，包括读取凭据和访问网络。";
"Hermesh can’t show this request in full (%@)." = "Hermesh 无法完整显示这个请求（%@）。";
"Hermesh doesn’t recognize this kind of request (%@)." = "Hermesh 不认识这种请求（%@）。";
"If the verification code doesn’t match, this isn’t the machine in front of you." = "核对码对不上，说明这不是你面前的那台机器。";
"In place: agents change the files in this directory directly" = "原地工作：agent 直接改这个目录里的文件";
"Issue this Mac a certificate for end-to-end connections" = "给这台 Mac 签发端到端连接证书";
"Issue this iPhone a certificate for end-to-end connections" = "给这台 iPhone 签发端到端连接证书";
"Machine ID %@…" = "机器 ID %@…";
"Machine ID: %@" = "机器 ID：%@";
"Machine “%@” (already yours)" = "机器「%@」（已经是你的机器）";
"Machines" = "机器";
"Machines: %@" = "机器：%@";
"Machines: %@ → %@" = "机器：%1$@ → %2$@";
"Model: %@" = "模型：%@";
"New settings:" = "修改后的设置：";
"On these machines: %@" = "在这些机器上：%@";
"Once approved, Hermesh on all your trusted devices and machines, this Mac included, erases its keys, sessions and settings, and your agents are disconnected. This can’t be undone." = "批准后，你所有可信设备和机器（包括这台 Mac）上的 Hermesh 会清除它的密钥、会话和设置，你的 agent 也会全部断开。此操作无法撤销。";
"Once approved, Hermesh on all your trusted devices and machines, this iPhone included, erases its keys, sessions and settings, and your agents are disconnected. This can’t be undone." = "批准后，你所有可信设备和机器（包括这台 iPhone）上的 Hermesh 会清除它的密钥、会话和设置，你的 agent 也会全部断开。此操作无法撤销。";
"Once approved, Hermesh on this Mac uses it for end-to-end encrypted connections to your machines, to view and manage your sessions and machines." = "批准后：这台 Mac 上的 Hermesh 用它和你的各台机器建立端到端加密连接，查看和管理你的会话与机器。";
"Once approved, Hermesh on this iPhone uses it for end-to-end encrypted connections to your machines, to view and manage your sessions and machines." = "批准后：这台 iPhone 上的 Hermesh 用它和你的各台机器建立端到端加密连接，查看和管理你的会话与机器。";
"Once approved, agents can no longer start sessions in this project; the files in the directory are not deleted." = "批准后：agent 不能再在这个项目里新开会话；目录里的文件不会被删除。";
"Once approved, it can no longer approve anything, and its own machine is removed with it; this Mac reissues the machine and personal agent credentials it signed." = "批准后：它立刻不能再批准任何事，它自己的执行机器也一并移除；它签过的机器和个人 agent 凭证由这台 Mac 重新签发。";
"Once approved, it can no longer approve anything, and its own machine is removed with it; this iPhone reissues the machine and personal agent credentials it signed." = "批准后：它立刻不能再批准任何事，它自己的执行机器也一并移除；它签过的机器和个人 agent 凭证由这台 iPhone 重新签发。";
"Once approved, it keeps the same access, now signed by this Mac; the old version stops working." = "批准后：它继续保持原来的权限，改由这台 Mac 签名，旧版本失效。";
"Once approved, it keeps the same access, now signed by this iPhone; the old version stops working." = "批准后：它继续保持原来的权限，改由这台 iPhone 签名，旧版本失效。";
"Once approved, its sessions there that name no model run with these; the agent’s own configuration is not changed." = "批准后：它在那台机器上没指定模型的会话都按这些设置运行，不改动这个 agent 自己的配置。";
"Once approved, the list above becomes your trusted devices." = "批准后：可信设备按上面的列表生效。";
"Once approved, the machine accepts new sessions again." = "批准后：这台机器重新开始接受新会话。";
"Once approved, the machine accepts no new sessions until you resume it, which you can do at any time." = "批准后：这台机器不再接受新会话，直到你恢复；你可以随时恢复。";
"Once approved, the machine registers the directory as a project, where personal agents with access can start sessions and read and write files." = "批准后：这台机器把该目录登记为项目，被授权的个人 agent 可以在里面开会话、读写文件。";
"Once approved, the new settings take effect at once (version %lld) and the old ones stop working; from then on it can act only within the new settings." = "批准后：新设置立刻生效（第 %lld 版），旧设置立即作废；它之后只能按新设置做事。";
"Once approved, this Mac becomes your first trusted device; any device that joins later must be approved by a trusted device." = "批准后：这台 Mac 成为你的第一台可信设备；以后加入的设备都要由可信设备批准。";
"Once approved, this iPhone becomes your first trusted device; any device that joins later must be approved by a trusted device." = "批准后：这台 iPhone 成为你的第一台可信设备；以后加入的设备都要由可信设备批准。";
"Once approved, this machine becomes yours, and agents you grant access can start sessions and run commands on it. Approve only if you know this machine; you can remove it later from the machine list." = "批准后：这台机器成为你的执行机器，你授权的 agent 可以在它上面开会话、运行命令。只在你认识这台机器时批准；以后可以在机器列表里移除。";
"Once approved, this machine stays yours, unchanged, now signed by this Mac." = "批准后：这台机器继续属于你，内容不变，改由这台 Mac 签名。";
"Once approved, this machine stays yours, unchanged, now signed by this iPhone." = "批准后：这台机器继续属于你，内容不变，改由这台 iPhone 签名。";
"Once approved, this machine stays yours." = "批准后：这台机器继续属于你。";
"Once approved, trusted clients you grant access can use and control the agents on this Mac, over end-to-end encrypted connections. You can turn this off in Settings at any time." = "批准后：你批准授权的可信客户端可以使用和操作这台 Mac 上的 agent，它们和这台 Mac 之间的连接端到端加密；随时可以在设置里关掉。";
"Owner identity ID: %@" = "管理身份 ID：%@";
"Pause %@" = "暂停%@";
"Personal agent “%@” (%@)" = "个人 agent「%1$@」（%2$@）";
"Project: %@" = "项目名：%@";
"Projects" = "项目";
"Projects it can use: %@" = "能用的项目：%@";
"Projects, machines and coding agents stay the same; only the expiry changes." = "项目、机器、编码 agent 都没有变化，只是更新有效期。";
"Projects: %@" = "项目：%@";
"Projects: %@ → %@" = "项目：%1$@ → %2$@";
"Reasoning effort: %@" = "推理强度：%@";
"Reissue the certificate of machine “%@”" = "重新签发机器「%@」的证书";
"Reissue the grant of “%@”" = "重新签发「%@」的授权";
"Remove project “%@” from %@" = "从%2$@删除项目「%1$@」";
"Remove trusted device “%@”" = "移除可信设备「%@」";
"Rename %@ to “%@”" = "把%1$@改名为「%2$@」";
