"Requested by %@" = "由 %@ 发起";
"Requested by an unknown program" = "由未知程序发起";
"Requested by the Hermesh app" = "由 Hermesh 应用发起";
"Resume %@" = "恢复%@";
"Same access: %@; %@; expires %@" = "权限范围不变：%1$@；%2$@；有效期至 %3$@";
"Same as %@" = "跟随 %@";
"Separate worktrees for git repositories; other directories in place" = "git 仓库用独立 worktree，其他目录原地工作";
"Sessions at once: up to %lld" = "最多同时运行 %lld 个会话";
"Set the model %@ runs with on %@" = "设置%2$@上 %1$@ 用的模型";
"Share the agents on this Mac" = "共享这台 Mac 上的 agent";
"Speed: %@" = "速度：%@";
"Standard" = "标准";
"The machine takes the new name; its projects and access stay the same." = "这台机器改用新名字，项目和权限不变。";
"The request can’t be parsed (%@)." = "请求内容无法解析（%@）。";
"The request contains something Hermesh doesn’t recognize (%@). Hermesh may need an update." = "请求里有 Hermesh 不认识的内容（%@），可能需要更新 Hermesh。";
"This sends a join request to your existing devices. Check the same code on one of them and approve, and this Mac becomes a trusted device." = "它会向你已有的设备发出加入请求。在那台设备上核对同一个码并批准，它就成为可信设备。";
"This sends a join request to your existing devices. Check the same code on one of them and approve, and this iPhone becomes a trusted device." = "它会向你已有的设备发出加入请求。在那台设备上核对同一个码并批准，它就成为可信设备。";
"Trusted devices" = "可信设备";
"Unknown program" = "未知程序";
"Unnamed device" = "未命名设备";
"Until %@" = "至 %@";
"Update your list of trusted devices" = "更新你的可信设备列表";
"Uses your owner key to issue it a connection grant, which you can revoke at any time. %@ holds this agent’s key: it can act as the agent within this access, and sees the sessions it reaches." = "用你的管理密钥，给它签发一份连接授权，随时可以撤销。%@ 保管这个 agent 的密钥：它可以在这个范围内代表该 agent 操作，并能看到它触及的会话。";
"Uses your owner key to issue it an end-to-end connection grant, which you can revoke at any time." = "用你的管理密钥，给它签发一份端到端连接授权，随时可以撤销。";
"Uses your owner key to make it a trusted device too, able to approve agents, machines and new devices just like this Mac." = "用你的管理密钥，让它也成为可信设备，能像这台 Mac 一样批准 Agent、机器和新设备。";
"Uses your owner key to make it a trusted device too, able to approve agents, machines and new devices just like this iPhone." = "用你的管理密钥，让它也成为可信设备，能像这台 iPhone 一样批准 Agent、机器和新设备。";
"Version %lld" = "第 %lld 版";
/* %@ is a request type */
"What would be signed doesn’t match what would be shown (%@)." = "要签名的内容和要显示的内容不一致（%@）。";
"Workspace: %@" = "工作方式：%@";
"Your owner key, instructing %@" = "你的管理密钥，对%@下达指令";
"Your trusted devices" = "你的可信设备";
"Your trusted devices after this: %@" = "签发后你的可信设备：%@";
